    {
      "title": "Join the Network",
      "desc": "Two formalities: hello, then join",
      "detail": "Open System authentication lets anyone this far: no password yet. Then the laptop asks to associate, repeating the security it chose (CCMP, with a password), and the access point gives it association ID 1. The laptop is connected, but the only thing it may send is the handshake that comes next.",
