            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Messages 3 and 4",
      "desc": "The 4-way handshake: keys",
      "detail": "Message 3 shows the access point has the same keys (its MIC checks out) and brings the group key (GTK) for broadcasts, encrypted. Message 4 says the laptop is ready, and both ends start encrypting.",
